WEBVTT

00:00.610 --> 00:03.970
Now we have all the food 
we'll need for today.

00:03.970 --> 00:06.140
Yep. Shall we head back?

00:06.140 --> 00:09.130
C'mon, you can't do that!

00:09.130 --> 00:10.850
Misjantie?

00:12.170 --> 00:13.730
What's going on?

00:13.730 --> 00:16.880
A-Azusa! I'm in a real bind here!

00:17.160 --> 00:20.870
It's the worst thing that's happened 
since I opened the Flatta branch!

00:21.120 --> 00:22.080
That's huge!

00:22.080 --> 00:25.740
Misjantie, you're building 
another new temple?

00:26.390 --> 00:29.250
It looks very impressive.

00:29.250 --> 00:32.130
This is not my temple!

00:32.130 --> 00:34.630
See? Look at that sign!

00:34.940 --> 00:39.040
"Live a life of virtue with 
the virtue stamp card.

00:39.040 --> 00:42.340
The Mega-mega Temple Flatta Branch."

00:42.660 --> 00:45.100
Wait, Mega-mega?

00:49.610 --> 00:54.420
What?! This is a temple to <i>that</i> goddess?!

01:03.620 --> 01:14.630
<b>I've Been Killing Slimes for 300 Years
and Maxed Out My Level Season 2</b>

02:25.370 --> 02:31.010
I never expected the goddess's temples to 
expand all the way out here to Flatta.

02:26.630 --> 02:29.420
<b>I Battled a Traditional Goddess</b>

02:31.300 --> 02:34.710
And right next to my branch, too!

02:34.710 --> 02:37.000
This is obstruction of business!

02:37.000 --> 02:39.000
I don't think that's...

02:39.000 --> 02:43.020
Still, the goddess's temple 
was definitely a lot bigger.

02:43.020 --> 02:47.510
Goddess or not, this is just tyranny!

02:47.510 --> 02:50.640
Next time I see her, I'm gonna 
give her a piece of my mind!

02:51.270 --> 02:54.650
Now, now. Just have some tea 
at my place and cheer up.

02:57.860 --> 03:01.650
This tea Falfa made for 
me is simply delicious!

03:02.100 --> 03:04.180
Huh?! Goddess Mega-mega?!

03:04.180 --> 03:05.030
What?!

03:05.030 --> 03:09.390
Falfa, here's a stamp for 
your virtue stamp card!

03:09.390 --> 03:11.300
Yay! I got a stamp!

03:12.050 --> 03:13.740
Oh, Mother.

03:13.740 --> 03:15.550
Welcome back!

03:16.020 --> 03:19.350
I've been waiting for you, Azusa!

03:19.350 --> 03:23.330
You see, I've decided to build 
a branch temple in Flatta,

03:23.330 --> 03:25.800
so I came to visit while I was in town!

03:25.800 --> 03:27.380
Um...

03:30.300 --> 03:34.570
Oh, my! If it isn't the pine spirit!

03:34.890 --> 03:38.170
<i>Uh-oh. She's really furious.</i>

03:41.030 --> 03:43.440
Misjantie! Take it easy!

03:46.730 --> 03:48.600
Great Goddess Mega-mega!

03:48.600 --> 03:52.140
I've heard all about your 
virtue stamp cards!

03:52.140 --> 03:56.080
I hope we can get along as neighbors!

03:56.080 --> 03:57.080
Wha...

03:57.360 --> 04:01.670
Anyway, Great Goddess Mega-mega, 
you sure are beautiful!

04:01.670 --> 04:05.420
And you have tons of followers, 
and your popularity's soaring!

04:05.420 --> 04:07.090
You're a real role model!

04:07.330 --> 04:10.090
Well, thank you!

04:10.090 --> 04:12.500
That's quite the about-face...

04:12.500 --> 04:15.220
And some very obvious brown-nosing.

04:15.470 --> 04:17.840
Incidentally, Great Goddess Mega-mega...

04:17.840 --> 04:19.500
I have a favor to ask.

04:19.500 --> 04:20.860
What might that be?

04:20.860 --> 04:24.940
If you have any followers 
who want to get married,

04:24.940 --> 04:28.240
please have them use my temple!

04:28.240 --> 04:31.000
<i>She's even throwing in a sales pitch.</i>

04:31.000 --> 04:33.340
Well...

04:33.340 --> 04:37.810
How about making weddings count 
toward the virtue stamp card?

04:37.810 --> 04:40.290
That's something I can do!

04:40.290 --> 04:42.890
Yes! That would be just fine!

04:43.210 --> 04:46.010
I'll give it serious thought, then!

04:46.420 --> 04:50.960
Let's get along well as 
neighbors from now on, okay?

04:50.960 --> 04:54.660
Yes, please! And we should do 
lots of collaborations, too!

04:56.220 --> 04:59.620
Looks like the problem she had 
with her temple is solved.

04:59.620 --> 05:02.240
Good for her... I guess?

05:02.570 --> 05:06.240
<b>One Week Later</b>

05:03.020 --> 05:06.230
Azusa, I'm back!

05:06.490 --> 05:09.240
Goddess?! What brings you here?

05:09.240 --> 05:12.530
Well, you see, I have a bit of a problem,

05:12.530 --> 05:15.630
and I was hoping you could help me.

05:15.630 --> 05:19.630
Really? So even gods have 
problems sometimes?

05:19.630 --> 05:20.700
Yes.

05:20.700 --> 05:22.670
Even with the power of a god,

05:22.670 --> 05:25.130
there are some things I just 
can't do anything about.

05:25.370 --> 05:28.770
The thing is... I now have a rival!

05:28.990 --> 05:30.360
A rival?

05:30.360 --> 05:33.760
Azusa, have you heard of the goddess Nintan?

05:33.760 --> 05:37.760
I've heard the name, but I 
don't know much about her.

05:37.760 --> 05:41.540
The goddess Nintan has been 
worshiped since ancient times.

05:41.540 --> 05:44.780
The royal capital even holds 
a huge festival for her.

05:44.780 --> 05:46.540
She's a very famous goddess.

05:46.900 --> 05:49.410
Nintan is also very crabby.

05:49.410 --> 05:53.910
It's said that she turns humans 
who are rude to her into frogs.

05:53.910 --> 05:55.460
Frogs?

05:55.910 --> 05:58.290
She sounds like a tyrannical goddess.

05:58.290 --> 06:00.770
Nintan is quite hard-headed.

06:00.770 --> 06:04.380
She favors tradition and 
rejects anything new.

06:04.380 --> 06:10.420
She's now started to restrict other 
deities from undertaking new activities.

06:10.420 --> 06:14.690
And you've fallen under her restrictions?

06:14.690 --> 06:15.950
Yes.

06:15.950 --> 06:20.280
She said I can't keep doing the virtue 
stamp cards because they're ridiculous.

06:20.690 --> 06:25.310
If things continue this way, I won't 
be able to distribute them anymore!

06:25.590 --> 06:28.970
I mean... that wouldn't 
be so terrible, would it?

06:28.970 --> 06:31.870
No, no, no, no, no! It'd be awful!

06:31.870 --> 06:37.820
But it's better than getting turned into 
a frog for something so silly, right?

06:37.820 --> 06:40.210
It's not silly at all!

06:40.210 --> 06:44.710
Virtue stamps are a wonderful 
system that enriches society!

06:45.760 --> 06:50.710
They're a new breeze blowing 
on a hardened world!

06:50.710 --> 06:54.050
I didn't realize you had such 
lofty ideals for them.

06:54.050 --> 06:57.680
Even for the goddess Nintan, 
it's just tyrannical!

06:57.680 --> 07:00.850
So I have no choice but to 
give her a piece of my mind!

07:01.210 --> 07:04.860
<i>I feel like I heard someone else say 
the same thing just recently...</i>

07:04.860 --> 07:08.990
And where could one find 
this goddess Nintan?

07:08.990 --> 07:12.720
The goddess Nintan lives at the 
Grand Nintan Temple in Nintania,

07:12.720 --> 07:15.120
a town on the outskirts 
of the royal capital.

07:15.540 --> 07:18.780
You'll come with me, won't you, Azusa?

07:19.300 --> 07:21.370
What?! Why me?!

07:21.370 --> 07:27.260
You're coming with me to ask her 
not to ban virtue stamp cards!

07:27.260 --> 07:29.120
What?! No way!

07:29.120 --> 07:32.150
She turns people into frogs, doesn't she?!

07:32.150 --> 07:35.510
Oh, please! I beg you!

07:35.510 --> 07:37.270
You're asking too much of me!

07:37.270 --> 07:39.640
What power would a human 
have in that situation?!

07:39.640 --> 07:46.860
But you're living a nice, happy, immortal, 
overpowered life thanks to me, are you not?

07:46.860 --> 07:49.800
And surrounded by so much family!

07:50.750 --> 07:53.490
Well, yes, but...

07:55.010 --> 07:57.460
All right, fine.

07:57.460 --> 08:00.460
But I'm only tagging along with you, okay?

08:00.460 --> 08:03.950
Yes, of course! 
I knew I could count on you, Azusa!

08:04.710 --> 08:09.590
<b>Nintania
Grand Nintan Temple</b>

08:06.610 --> 08:09.590
Wow, what an impressive temple.

08:09.590 --> 08:14.070
The goddess Nintan descended 
upon this land long, long ago.

08:14.070 --> 08:16.230
The area then became the town of Nintania,

08:16.230 --> 08:18.610
and this temple was built for her.

08:18.940 --> 08:21.910
I'm so glad I got to come 
here during my lifetime.

08:21.910 --> 08:24.340
I've fulfilled the pilgrimage of my dreams.

08:24.340 --> 08:29.390
Devout followers like them come from 
all over the country to worship her.

08:29.720 --> 08:32.860
And Nintan herself is here, too?

08:32.860 --> 08:33.980
Yes.

08:33.980 --> 08:37.110
But she remains invisible to 
ordinary folk, of course.

08:37.400 --> 08:39.920
If she were to just reveal 
herself without thought,

08:39.920 --> 08:42.370
it would be a massive blow 
to her divine dignity!

08:42.370 --> 08:44.250
That's funny, coming from you.

08:51.290 --> 08:54.250
This is the statue of the goddess Nintan.

08:54.250 --> 08:56.360
It sure is impressive.

08:58.850 --> 09:01.010
Well, shall we enter?

09:01.010 --> 09:03.320
Huh? Enter where?

09:03.320 --> 09:06.050
Make absolutely certain you 
don't let go of my hand!

09:06.050 --> 09:06.900
Wai—

09:09.400 --> 09:12.190
We're gonna crash!

09:21.760 --> 09:22.950
<i>What...</i>

09:23.630 --> 09:25.810
Okay, we're here!

09:25.810 --> 09:26.330
Huh?

09:26.700 --> 09:27.970
Is this...

09:27.970 --> 09:30.050
It's Nintan's dimension.

09:30.710 --> 09:33.090
So it's the realm of gods?

09:33.090 --> 09:36.590
And that is the goddess Nintan.

09:52.440 --> 09:53.970
What is your business?

10:00.440 --> 10:03.090
Goddess! Please, take it easy!

10:04.260 --> 10:08.460
It's a pleasure to meet you! I am Mega-mega!

10:08.460 --> 10:09.460
What?!

10:09.460 --> 10:15.720
I've come here today hoping to build a good 
relationship with you, my senior goddess!

10:16.080 --> 10:17.290
Déjà vu!

10:18.200 --> 10:19.160
Oh?

10:21.710 --> 10:25.300
This is a gift for you. 
They're Snack Slimes.

10:25.300 --> 10:27.610
I do hope you like them!

10:27.610 --> 10:29.340
Where'd you just pull those from?!

10:29.620 --> 10:33.230
No need. I dislike sweet things.

10:33.230 --> 10:36.860
So you prefer spirits and 
savory snacks, then!

10:36.860 --> 10:39.850
In that case... please take this!

10:39.850 --> 10:41.360
Again, where were you keeping that?!

10:41.360 --> 10:42.490
No need.

10:42.490 --> 10:44.230
Oh, don't be like that!

10:44.550 --> 10:48.370
You are trying to sway me 
with gifts, are you not?

10:48.500 --> 10:49.370
<b>Flinch!</b>

10:49.360 --> 10:52.150
I know what your scheme is.

10:52.150 --> 10:55.050
You feel your teachings will be oppressed,

10:55.050 --> 10:58.540
so you came hoping to make a 
sweetheart deal with me, correct?

10:59.380 --> 11:03.780
Mega-mega, there are many 
gods in this world.

11:03.780 --> 11:05.780
I know this well,

11:05.780 --> 11:08.390
and I have graciously 
overlooked most things.

11:08.390 --> 11:11.720
So you'll graciously overlook me, too?

11:11.720 --> 11:13.270
Thank you so much!

11:13.270 --> 11:14.860
Silence, child!

11:14.860 --> 11:18.920
I know your game! What are these 
"virtue stamps" of yours?!

11:18.920 --> 11:21.370
Ah, you know about that?

11:21.370 --> 11:22.870
Of course I do!

11:22.870 --> 11:26.290
There is not a trace of divine 
dignity to be found in it!

11:26.290 --> 11:30.120
A god must be more lofty and sublime!

11:30.120 --> 11:32.630
Enough of your silly games!

11:33.480 --> 11:37.500
W-Well, I can't deny that it's silly, but...

11:37.770 --> 11:39.880
<i>So you admit that?</i>

11:39.880 --> 11:45.630
I think it's good for fun things 
like that to exist in the world.

11:45.630 --> 11:50.630
Perhaps even such ridiculous things 
have their own value?

11:51.890 --> 11:56.140
No, in fact, I think a thing can 
be good even if it has no value!

11:56.140 --> 11:59.030
That's why gods like me exist!

11:59.030 --> 12:01.790
A new breeze is a good thing!

12:02.360 --> 12:06.280
Mega-mega, what are you trying to say?

12:06.280 --> 12:10.170
If you are saying all this with 
the impassioned resolve of a god,

12:10.170 --> 12:11.920
show that to me.

12:11.920 --> 12:14.420
Huh? Hmm...

12:15.180 --> 12:16.920
<i>She's got nothing!</i>

12:17.170 --> 12:19.350
I just think it would be a good thing

12:19.350 --> 12:22.670
to have people who do kind things, 
no matter how small or simple.

12:22.670 --> 12:28.300
I just think it'd be nice to keep that up, 
without too much thought, for the long haul.

12:29.690 --> 12:34.220
You have no understanding of 
divinity or tradition at all.

12:34.220 --> 12:35.570
Leave now.

12:35.570 --> 12:39.440
I will instruct my priests 
to ban your teachings.

12:39.440 --> 12:40.940
Please, anything but that!

12:40.940 --> 12:44.190
Leave, or I will turn you into a frog.

12:47.040 --> 12:48.610
Goddess?

12:49.900 --> 12:52.030
I see I have no choice.

12:52.030 --> 12:54.380
It's time for my last resort.

12:55.210 --> 12:59.340
Tell me that you approve 
of my virtue stamp cards!

13:03.660 --> 13:06.010
You wish to challenge me 
in a contest of strength?

13:06.520 --> 13:07.710
How amusing.

13:09.630 --> 13:12.810
This goddess and her follower 
who have come to offend me

13:12.810 --> 13:14.490
will be eliminated together.

13:14.490 --> 13:16.850
What?! Why me, too?!

13:16.850 --> 13:20.600
You will regret drawing a blade against me.

13:20.600 --> 13:23.110
Will I, now?

13:23.930 --> 13:27.560
Have a taste of my 
traditional swordsmanship!

13:26.680 --> 13:28.230
Prepare yourself!

13:28.230 --> 13:30.050
She was still talking!

13:30.500 --> 13:34.000
<b>I've Been Killing Slimes for 300 Years
and Maxed Out My Level Season 2</b>

13:39.550 --> 13:41.150
Insolence!

13:41.150 --> 13:43.430
I will reduce you to rust on my sword!

13:57.280 --> 13:59.970
So this is a battle between gods?

14:00.280 --> 14:01.790
Wow...

14:07.370 --> 14:10.650
You do have some skill.

14:11.020 --> 14:12.880
But of course!

14:12.880 --> 14:17.170
We may both be gods, 
but I am a god of high rank!

14:18.880 --> 14:20.210
What does that mean?

14:20.540 --> 14:23.570
In the past, I oversaw not only this world,

14:23.570 --> 14:26.340
but multiple others as their god.

14:26.340 --> 14:31.480
You, on the other hand, are just one of 
the gods that oversee only this world!

14:32.730 --> 14:36.230
In other words, if I'm an 
executive at headquarters,

14:36.230 --> 14:38.480
you're basically a regional branch manager!

14:38.990 --> 14:41.050
We're on different levels!

14:42.110 --> 14:45.070
Though I'm only a "former" 
executive since I goofed up.

14:45.590 --> 14:47.350
You didn't have to add that!

14:47.350 --> 14:49.490
Hmph! Impudence!

14:54.880 --> 14:58.560
I've only used 50... 60...

14:58.560 --> 15:02.340
no, 90 percent of my strength so far!

15:02.340 --> 15:03.750
That's about all of it!

15:04.630 --> 15:07.550
In this world, it is not 
a newcomer like you,

15:07.550 --> 15:09.760
but a god with a history such 
as myself who ranks higher!

15:15.010 --> 15:16.700
Taste this!

15:21.960 --> 15:23.890
Oh, no!

15:29.300 --> 15:30.650
Ribbit, ribbit!

15:30.650 --> 15:32.150
Goddess?!

15:34.270 --> 15:36.150
That is my secret art!

15:36.150 --> 15:40.040
Oh, no! I've been turned 
into a frog, ribbit!

15:40.040 --> 15:41.950
Wait, you can speak?

15:41.950 --> 15:43.830
I guess so, ribbit.

15:43.830 --> 15:45.920
You've gained some weird tic, though.

15:46.780 --> 15:49.520
You have insulted me quite enough.

15:49.520 --> 15:51.420
I cannot forgive this.

15:51.420 --> 15:52.810
Ribbit...

15:52.020 --> 15:54.700
There is no need for a new breeze.

15:54.700 --> 15:57.920
People can live peaceful 
lives simply by spending

15:57.920 --> 16:00.180
an eternity without change, can they not?

16:39.800 --> 16:43.120
It was you who made the first move.

16:43.120 --> 16:44.810
You will regret that!

16:44.810 --> 16:46.740
Ribbit!

16:49.290 --> 16:50.620
Ribbit...

16:51.400 --> 16:53.560
I get what you're saying.

16:53.560 --> 16:56.450
An easy life where nothing 
ever changes is nice.

16:56.450 --> 16:57.610
But you know...

16:57.610 --> 17:02.240
You can't say there's never any need 
for a new breeze at all, can you?

17:02.600 --> 17:03.540
What?

17:03.870 --> 17:06.470
What's wrong with the virtue stamp cards?

17:06.470 --> 17:08.770
People have fun using them.

17:08.770 --> 17:09.870
And...

17:10.210 --> 17:13.020
I don't think it's right 
to bully the weak, either!

17:14.200 --> 17:16.500
You would defy me, as well?

17:16.880 --> 17:19.170
Step aside, Witch of the Highlands!

17:19.170 --> 17:22.100
You may be the strongest of humans, 
but you cannot defeat a god!

17:22.590 --> 17:25.320
So you know who I am, huh?

17:25.320 --> 17:27.270
I don't know if I'm the strongest,

17:27.270 --> 17:30.520
but I owe the goddess 
Mega-mega a great debt.

17:38.420 --> 17:40.450
And if I left her to die now,

17:40.450 --> 17:43.110
I'd be denying everything 
I've been up until now!

17:43.110 --> 17:44.750
Azusa...

17:45.250 --> 17:48.120
What a virtuous heart you have, ribbit!

17:48.120 --> 17:52.560
For your courage, 
I present you with this, ribbit!

17:53.260 --> 17:55.380
A virtue stamp card?!

17:55.380 --> 17:58.560
It's not just a regular 
virtue stamp card, ribbit!

17:58.560 --> 18:01.140
It's a Gold Virtue Stamp Card, ribbit!

18:01.140 --> 18:02.770
And I should care because?!

18:03.000 --> 18:08.270
Those who complete a Gold Virtue 
Stamp Card such truly noble beings...

18:08.270 --> 18:13.310
that they are granted powers 
close to those of the gods!

18:13.980 --> 18:17.730
To put it simply, it's a level up!

18:27.790 --> 18:32.540
<b>Azusa Aizawa 
Job: Witch Who Has Received a Goddess's Blessing 
Stamina: 856  Magic: 
Attack: 896  Speed: 
Defense: 788  Intelligence: 
Magic</b>

18:28.210 --> 18:32.540
I thought I'd maxed out my level, 
but I'm even stronger now!

18:32.540 --> 18:36.670
<b>Lv. God-Tier</b>

18:33.230 --> 18:36.180
You've attained God-Tier level?!

18:36.980 --> 18:38.970
A mere human?!

18:38.970 --> 18:41.060
I refuse to acknowledge this!

18:41.320 --> 18:42.340
<i>I can see it.</i>

18:45.850 --> 18:47.180
<i>I can move so well!</i>

18:47.180 --> 18:51.600
<i>It's like if my corporate slave 
body reverted to high school age!</i>

18:52.180 --> 18:53.600
<i>I feel so light!</i>

18:53.850 --> 18:56.870
There is no precedent for this!

18:57.220 --> 18:58.690
I will not accept it!

19:04.380 --> 19:06.840
It doesn't matter if you don't accept it.

19:06.840 --> 19:12.470
But attacking a powerless frog with a sword 
isn't a good thing for a god to do, is it?

19:14.050 --> 19:17.580
Still, I cannot yield to a human!

19:17.580 --> 19:19.840
You're so stubborn.

19:19.840 --> 19:21.670
I'll make you a frog, as well!

19:23.750 --> 19:28.100
Isn't the most important thing 
for everyone to be happy?

19:28.810 --> 19:32.600
If Mega-mega's teachings 
are making people happy,

19:32.600 --> 19:35.540
I don't think it's right to get rid 
of them just because they're weird.

19:38.740 --> 19:40.230
At the very least...

19:40.810 --> 19:43.360
I'm definitely happy right now.

19:43.740 --> 19:45.740
Ribbit...

19:49.330 --> 19:52.250
You win. I admit defeat.

19:57.070 --> 20:02.050
Goddess Nintan, will you acknowledge 
Mega-mega's teachings?

20:02.050 --> 20:03.380
Very well.

20:05.880 --> 20:08.900
I approve of your so-called 
virtue stamp cards.

20:08.900 --> 20:11.380
We did it, ribbit!

20:12.430 --> 20:16.640
Perhaps I was a bit narrow-minded.

20:17.090 --> 20:21.220
My respect for tradition made 
me unable to accept change.

20:21.680 --> 20:24.660
To think a human had to teach me that.

20:24.660 --> 20:26.470
Aw...

20:28.100 --> 20:30.300
You have bested me.

20:30.300 --> 20:34.060
You are free to call me simply 
"Nintan" from now on.

20:34.060 --> 20:35.930
What?! I couldn't!

20:35.930 --> 20:40.180
It is the implementation of new 
things in this town and temple

20:40.180 --> 20:42.110
that keeps traditions alive.

20:42.970 --> 20:45.830
I did not realize such an obvious fact.

20:46.860 --> 20:49.330
Ah, I get it!

20:49.330 --> 20:53.280
Your adherence to old ideas stopped 
you from accepting anything new.

20:53.280 --> 20:55.670
In other words, Nintan...

20:55.670 --> 20:57.930
you were troubling society 
by being old, ribbit!

20:59.600 --> 21:01.690
E-Excuse me?!

21:01.690 --> 21:04.880
Never mind! I will be fully 
banishing your teachings!

21:04.880 --> 21:07.610
I will eliminate 
virtue stamp cards from this world!

21:07.610 --> 21:11.710
Oh? Should a goddess go 
back on her word, ribbit?

21:11.710 --> 21:13.310
Silence!

21:13.840 --> 21:17.890
Oh, come on! We had everything 
wrapped up so nicely!

21:21.990 --> 21:25.660
Boy, I wasn't sure what was gonna 
happen for a minute there,

21:25.660 --> 21:28.540
but the virtue stamp card 
problem's been resolved,

21:28.540 --> 21:31.480
and Nintan isn't mad anymore. What a relief.

21:31.480 --> 21:33.730
What a relief, ribbit!

21:34.970 --> 21:37.340
We forgot to get her to turn you back!

21:37.340 --> 21:38.180
Ribbit...

23:09.950 --> 23:12.450
<b>Days in the Highlands</b>

23:10.370 --> 23:12.130
Days in the Highlands!

23:12.440 --> 23:13.840
Very well!

23:13.840 --> 23:17.590
If you draw a winner, you must 
approve of virtue stamp cards!

23:17.930 --> 23:20.470
Wait. Let me see them all first.

23:20.710 --> 23:21.960
<b>Flinch</b>

23:22.350 --> 23:23.850
They're all winners!

23:24.460 --> 23:26.210
<b>Part 2</b>

23:24.800 --> 23:26.200
Part 2!

23:26.200 --> 23:28.530
I found an amazing mushroom!

23:28.530 --> 23:30.500
It makes you grow taller!

23:30.500 --> 23:32.220
Wow, really?

23:32.220 --> 23:34.630
Let's try them right away!

23:36.720 --> 23:37.970
It works!

23:37.970 --> 23:39.220
Uh, I'd say not.
